---

<div class='landing'>
 <div class='boot-splash' data-boot-splash aria-hidden='true'>
  <div class='boot-splash-inner'>
   <img
    src='/bat1.png'
    alt=''
    class='boot-splash-bat'
    width='72'
    height='39'
   />
   <p class='boot-splash-brand'>Balambam Boo Fest</p>
   <p
    class='boot-splash-countdown'
    data-countdown
    data-event={eventIso}
   >
    {countdownLabel(daysLeftSSR)}
   </p>
   <p class='boot-splash-year'>para el 31 de octubre</p>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class='bats-layer' aria-hidden='true'>
  {
   bats.map((bat, index) => (
    <span
     class='bat'
     data-egg-bat
     data-speed={bat.speed}
     data-rotate={bat.rotate}
     style={`top:${bat.top};${bat.left ? `left:${bat.left};` : ""}${bat.right ? `right:${bat.right};` : ""}width:${bat.size}px;--bat-rotate:${bat.rotate}deg;--bat-delay:${(index % 7) * 0.35}s;--bat-duration:${3.2 + (index % 5) * 0.45}s;`}
     data-bat={index}
    >
     <img
      src={bat.src}
      alt=''
      class='bat-img'
      width={bat.size}
      height={Math.round(bat.size * 0.54)}
      loading='lazy'
     />
    </span>
   ))
  }
 </div>
 <div class='crossing-bats' aria-hidden='true'>
  <img
   src='/bat1.png'
   alt=''
   class='crossing-bat crossing-bat--a'
   data-egg-bat
   width='56'
   height='30'
  />
  <img
   src='/bat2.png'
   alt=''
   class='crossing-bat crossing-bat--b'
   data-egg-bat
   width='44'
   height='24'
  />
  <img
   src='/bat1.png'
   alt=''
   class='crossing-bat crossing-bat--c'
   data-egg-bat
   width='38'
   height='21'
  />
 </div>
 <section class='hero' aria-label='Cartel Balambam Boo Fest 2026'>
  <div class='hero-caption'>
   <p class='hero-brand'>Balambam Boo Fest</p>
   <h1 class='hero-title'>Edición Halloween 2026</h1>
   <p class='hero-lead'>
    Un día de conciertos, actividades, talleres y muchas cosas más. Sábado 31 de
    octubre · Terraza Summerland (Toledo).
   </p>
   <div class='hero-witch-parallax' data-witch-parallax aria-hidden='true'>
    <div class='hero-witch-fly'>
     <img
      src={witchImg.src}
      alt=''
      class='hero-witch'
      width={witchImg.width}
      height={witchImg.height}
     />
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class='hero-ctas'>
    <a
     href={ticketsUrl}
     target='_blank'
     rel='noopener noreferrer'
     class='cta cta-primary cta-closing'>Comprar entradas</a
    >
    <a href='#info' class='cta cta-secondary'>Ver info</a>
   </div>
  </div>
  <img
   src={cartelBbf26.src}
   alt='Cartel Balambam Boo Fest 2026 — Sábado 31 de octubre en Terraza Summerland'
   class='hero-poster reveal'
   data-reveal
   width={cartelBbf26.width}
   height={cartelBbf26.height}
  />
 </section>

 <section class='intro reveal' id='intro' data-reveal>
  <Typography variant='headline-3'>Edición Halloween 2026</Typography>
  <Typography variant='body'>
   Tras celebrar una década, <strong>Balambam Boo</strong> vuelve con una edición
   especial de Halloween: un festival para todas las edades, con conciertos, DJs,
   talleres, actividades y ambiente de terraza hasta que se vaya el sol.
  </Typography>
  <Typography variant='body'>
   El <strong>sábado 31 de octubre de 2026</strong> abrimos puertas a las
   <strong>12:00 h</strong> en la <strong>Terraza Summerland</strong> (La Peraleda,
   Toledo). Menores de 16 años gratis.
  </Typography>
 </section>

 <section class='info reveal' id='info' data-reveal>
  <div class='info-block' data-reveal-child style='--reveal-delay: 0ms'>
   <p class='info-label'>Cuándo</p>
   <p class='info-value'>Sábado 31 de octubre · 12:00 h</p>
  </div>
  <div class='info-block' data-reveal-child style='--reveal-delay: 100ms'>
   <p class='info-label'>Dónde</p>
   <p class='info-value'>Terraza Summerland · La Peraleda, Toledo</p>
  </div>
  <div class='info-block' data-reveal-child style='--reveal-delay: 200ms'>
   <p class='info-label'>Entradas</p>
   <p class='info-value'>10 € anticipada · 12 € en taquilla</p>
   <p class='info-note'>Menores de 16 años gratis</p>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section
  class='countdown reveal'
  id='countdown'
  data-reveal
  aria-live='polite'
 >
  <p
   class='countdown-text'
   data-countdown
   data-event={eventIso}
  >
   {countdownLabel(daysLeftSSR)}
  </p>
  <p class='countdown-sub'>para el sábado 31 de octubre</p>
 </section>

 <section class='lineup reveal' id='lineup' data-reveal>
  <Typography
   variant='headline-1'
   as='h2'
   className='lineup-heading'
  >
   Grupos
  </Typography>
  <ul class='lineup-list'>
   {
    lineup.map((band) => (
     <li class:list={["lineup-item", { "lineup-item--special": band.special }]}>
      {band.href ? (
       <a
        href={band.href}
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'
        class='lineup-link'
        aria-label={`${band.name} en Instagram`}
       >
        {band.name}
       </a>
      ) : (
       <button
        type='button'
        class='lineup-link lineup-link--special'
        aria-haspopup='dialog'
        aria-controls='children-modal'
        data-special-trigger
       >
        {band.name}
       </button>
      )}
     </li>
    ))
   }
  </ul>
  <Typography variant='body' className='lineup-djs'>
   Jornada amenizada con las pnchadas en riguroso vinilo de los DJs{" "}
   <strong>{djs.join(" & ")}</strong>.
  </Typography>
 </section>

 <section class='closing reveal' data-reveal>
  <Typography variant='headline-3'>¿Te vienes?</Typography>
  <Typography variant='body'>
   Las entradas anticipadas ya están a la venta. Y como es Halloween, os
   esperamos disfrazados: cuanto más terrorífico, mejor.
  </Typography>
  <a
   href={ticketsUrl}
   target='_blank'
   rel='noopener noreferrer'
   class='cta cta-primary cta-closing'
  >
   Comprar entradas
  </a>
 </section>

 <div class='egg-toast' data-egg-toast hidden role='status'>
  <p class='egg-toast-kicker'>¡Pip pip!</p>
  <p class='egg-toast-title'>¡La bruja te ha visto!</p>
  <p class='egg-toast-sub'>Nos vemos el 31 de octubre</p>
 </div>
</div>

<dialog
 class='children-modal'
 id='children-modal'
 aria-labelledby='children-modal-title'
>
 <button
  type='button'
  class='children-modal-close'
  data-modal-close
  aria-label='Cerrar'
 >
  ×
 </button>
 <img
  src={misfitsSkull.src}
  alt='Calavera Crimson Ghost de The Misfits'
  class='children-modal-skull'
  width={misfitsSkull.width}
  height={misfitsSkull.height}
 />
 <h2 id='children-modal-title' class='children-modal-title'>
  Children in Heat
 </h2>
 <p class='children-modal-text'>
  Proyecto one-shot de Halloween · covers de The Misfits · solo el 31 de
  octubre. Nacen, tocan y desaparecen. Como debe ser.
 </p>
</dialog>

<script>
 const trigger = document.querySelector("[data-special-trigger]")
 const modal = document.getElementById(
  "children-modal",
 ) as HTMLDialogElement | null
 const closeBtn = document.querySelector("[data-modal-close]")

 function openModal() {
  if (!modal) return
  modal.showModal()
 }

 function closeModal() {
  if (!modal) return
  modal.close()
 }

 trigger?.addEventListener("click", openModal)
 closeBtn?.addEventListener("click", closeModal)

 modal?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
  if (event.target === modal) closeModal()
 })

 const bats = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".bat")
 const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia(
  "(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)",
 ).matches
 let ticking = false

 function initEasterEggs() {
  const witch = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".hero-witch")
  const toast = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-egg-toast]")
  const eggBats = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-egg-bat]")
  let batHits = 0
  let batEggDone = false

  const landing = document.querySelector(".landing")

  function spawnBatHitCue(bat: HTMLElement, count: number) {
   const rect = bat.getBoundingClientRect()
   const cue = document.createElement("span")
   cue.className = "bat-hit-cue"
   cue.textContent = `${count}/5`
   cue.style.left = `${rect.left + rect.width / 2}px`
   cue.style.top = `${rect.top + rect.height / 2}px`
   ;(landing ?? document.body).appendChild(cue)
   requestAnimationFrame(() => cue.classList.add("is-on"))
   window.setTimeout(() => {
    cue.classList.remove("is-on")
    cue.classList.add("is-out")
    window.setTimeout(() => cue.remove(), 320)
   }, 700)
  }

  eggBats.forEach((bat) => {
   bat.setAttribute("title", "¿Pip?")
   bat.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    event.preventDefault()
    event.stopPropagation()
    if (batEggDone) return

    bat.classList.remove("is-bonked")
    void bat.offsetWidth
    bat.classList.add("is-bonked")
    window.setTimeout(() => bat.classList.remove("is-bonked"), 450)

    batHits += 1
    spawnBatHitCue(bat, batHits)

    if (batHits < 5) return

    batEggDone = true
    witch?.classList.add("is-egg-spin")
    window.setTimeout(
     () => witch?.classList.remove("is-egg-spin"),
     reduceMotion ? 0 : 1600,
    )

    if (!toast) return
    toast.hidden = false
    requestAnimationFrame(() => toast.classList.add("is-visible"))
    window.setTimeout(() => {
     toast.classList.remove("is-visible")
     window.setTimeout(() => {
      toast.hidden = true
     }, 350)
    }, 3200)
   })
  })

  const konami = [
   "ArrowUp",
   "ArrowUp",
   "ArrowDown",
   "ArrowDown",
   "ArrowLeft",
   "ArrowRight",
   "ArrowLeft",
   "ArrowRight",
   "b",
   "a",
  ]
  let konamiIndex = 0

  window.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
   const key =
    event.key.length === 1 ? event.key.toLowerCase() : event.key
   if (key === konami[konamiIndex]) {
    konamiIndex += 1
    if (konamiIndex === konami.length) {
     konamiIndex = 0
     openModal()
    }
    return
   }
   konamiIndex = key === konami[0] ? 1 : 0
  })
 }

 initEasterEggs()

 function initBootSplash() {
  const splash = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-boot-splash]")
  if (!splash || splash.dataset.played === "1") return

  if (reduceMotion) {
   document.documentElement.style.setProperty("--boot-splash-ms", "0ms")
   splash.remove()
   return
  }

  splash.dataset.played = "1"
  document.documentElement.classList.add("boot-splash-active")

  const splashMs = 2000
  document.documentElement.style.setProperty(
   "--boot-splash-ms",
   `${splashMs}ms`,
  )

  window.setTimeout(() => {
   splash.classList.add("is-done")
   document.documentElement.classList.remove("boot-splash-active")
   const cleanup = () => splash.remove()
   splash.addEventListener("transitionend", cleanup, { once: true })
   // Por si transitionend no dispara
   window.setTimeout(cleanup, 500)
  }, splashMs)
 }

 initBootSplash()
 document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initBootSplash)

 const witchParallax = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(
  "[data-witch-parallax]",
 )
 const WITCH_SPEED = 0.22

 function updateScrollNight() {
  const max = Math.max(
   document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight,
   1,
  )
  const raw = window.scrollY / max
  // Empieza ~25% del scroll y llega a noche plena al final
  const t = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (raw - 0.25) / 0.75))
  const eased = t * t * (3 - 2 * t)
  document.documentElement.style.setProperty(
   "--scroll-night",
   eased.toFixed(4),
  )
 }

 function updateParallax() {
  if (reduceMotion) return
  const y = window.scrollY
  bats.forEach((bat) => {
   const speed = Number(bat.dataset.speed || 0.2)
   // Capas más separadas: vertical fuerte + ligero drift horizontal
   const depth = 0.08 + speed * 1.55
   bat.style.transform = `translate3d(${y * speed * 0.12}px, ${y * depth}px, 0)`
  })
  if (witchParallax) {
   witchParallax.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${y * WITCH_SPEED}px, 0)`
  }
  ticking = false
 }

 function onScroll() {
  updateScrollNight()
  if (reduceMotion || ticking) return
  ticking = true
  requestAnimationFrame(updateParallax)
 }

 window.addEventListener("scroll", onScroll, { passive: true })
 updateScrollNight()
 updateParallax()

 function initCountdown() {
  const els = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-countdown]")
  if (!els.length) return
  const eventIsoAttr = els[0].dataset.event
  if (!eventIsoAttr) return

  const eventMs = new Date(eventIsoAttr).getTime()
  const dayMs = 1000 * 60 * 60 * 24

  function label(days: number) {
   if (days > 1) return `Faltan ${days} días`
   if (days === 1) return "Falta 1 día"
   if (days === 0) return "¡Es hoy!"
   return "¡Gracias por venir!"
  }

  function tick() {
   const days = Math.ceil((eventMs - Date.now()) / dayMs)
   const text = label(days)
   els.forEach((el) => {
    el.textContent = text
   })
  }

  tick()
  // Recalcula al cambiar de día (cada hora basta)
  window.setInterval(tick, 60 * 60 * 1000)
 }

 initCountdown()

 function initScrollReveal() {
  const items = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-reveal]")
  if (!items.length) return

  if (reduceMotion) {
   items.forEach((el) => el.classList.add("is-revealed"))
   return
  }

  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
   (entries) => {
    entries.forEach((entry) => {
     if (!entry.isIntersecting) return
     entry.target.classList.add("is-revealed")
     observer.unobserve(entry.target)
    })
   },
   {
    threshold: 0.18,
    rootMargin: "0px 0px -8% 0px",
   },
  )

  items.forEach((el) => observer.observe(el))
 }

 initScrollReveal()
 document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initScrollReveal)

 document.documentElement.classList.remove("has-bat-cursor")
</script>

<style>
 .landing {
  --bbf-orange: #e06731;
  --bbf-orange-soft: color-mix(in srgb, #e06731 50%, white);
  --bbf-orange-deep: #c45322;
  --bbf-navy: #203048;
  --bbf-cream: #fff6eb;
  --bbf-ink: color-mix(
   in srgb,
   var(--bbf-cream) calc(var(--scroll-night, 0) * 100%),
   var(--bbf-navy)
  );
  --bbf-page-bg: color-mix(
   in srgb,
   var(--bbf-navy) calc(var(--scroll-night, 0) * 88%),
   var(--bbf-orange-soft)
  );

  position: relative;
  background: var(--bbf-page-bg);
  color: var(--bbf-ink);
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: visible;
 }

 .boot-splash {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 10000;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background:
   radial-gradient(
    ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 45%,
    color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-orange) 55%, var(--bbf-navy)) 0%,
    var(--bbf-navy) 70%
   );
  opacity: 1;
  transition: opacity 0.45s ease;
 }

 .boot-splash.is-done {
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
 }

 :global(html.boot-splash-active),
 :global(html.boot-splash-active body) {
  overflow: hidden;
 }

 .boot-splash-inner {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 24px;
  animation: bootSplashIn 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
 }

 .boot-splash-bat {
  width: clamp(56px, 12vw, 88px);
  height: auto;
  filter: brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(96%) sepia(12%) saturate(500%)
   hue-rotate(330deg) drop-shadow(0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25));
  animation: bootBatFlap 0.55s ease-in-out infinite;
 }

 .boot-splash-brand {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 5vw, 2rem);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 85%, var(--bbf-orange));
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
 }

 .boot-splash-countdown {
  margin: 4px 0 0;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 9vw, 4rem);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
 }

 .boot-splash-year {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2.2vw, 1.05rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 75%, var(--bbf-orange));
 }

 .bats-layer {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
 }

 .crossing-bats {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
 }

 .crossing-bat {
  position: absolute;
  height: auto;
  opacity: 0;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 2px rgba(32, 48, 72, 0.15));
  pointer-events: auto;
  touch-action: manipulation;
 }

 .crossing-bat--a {
  top: 18%;
  width: 56px;
  animation: batCrossLTR 16s linear 3.5s infinite;
 }

 .crossing-bat--b {
  top: 48%;
  width: 44px;
  animation: batCrossRTL 20s linear 8s infinite;
 }

 .crossing-bat--c {
  top: 72%;
  width: 38px;
  animation: batCrossLTRAlt 18s linear 13s infinite;
 }

 .bat {
  position: absolute;
  display: block;
  line-height: 0;
  opacity: 0.65;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  will-change: transform;
  user-select: none;
  transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  pointer-events: auto;
  touch-action: manipulation;
  /* Zona de click un poco más amplia */
  padding: 10px;
  margin: -10px;
  box-sizing: content-box;
 }

 .bat.is-bonked .bat-img {
  animation: batBonk 0.45s ease-out;
 }

 .bat-hit-cue {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 10001;
  translate: -50% -50%;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 2px solid #203048;
  background: #fff6eb;
  color: #203048;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  line-height: 1;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.85);
  transition:
   opacity 0.2s ease,
   transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #e06731;
 }

 .bat-hit-cue.is-on {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(-28px) scale(1.05);
 }

 .bat-hit-cue.is-out {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(-48px) scale(0.9);
 }

 .bat-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  transform-origin: center center;
  animation: batFly var(--bat-duration, 4s) ease-in-out var(--bat-delay, 0s)
   infinite;
 }

 .hero,
 .intro,
 .info,
 .lineup,
 .closing {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
 }

 .hero {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  background: transparent;
 }

 .hero-caption {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 920px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  min-height: calc(100vh - 12vh);
  min-height: calc(100svh - 12svh);
  min-height: calc(100dvh - 12svh);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: clamp(12px, 2.5svh, 28px) 16px clamp(24px, 4svh, 40px);
  text-align: center;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(18px);
  animation: fadeUp 0.85s ease-out 0.1s forwards;
 }

 .hero-ctas {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: clamp(4px, 1svh, 10px);
  margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 3svh, 28px);
 }

 .hero-poster {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 900px;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  margin: 0 auto clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
 }

 .reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translate3d(0, 36px, 0);
  transition:
   opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
   transform 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  will-change: opacity, transform;
 }

 .reveal.is-revealed {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
 }

 .info.reveal .info-block {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translate3d(0, 24px, 0);
  transition:
   opacity 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
   transform 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  transition-delay: var(--reveal-delay, 0ms);
 }

 .info.reveal.is-revealed .info-block {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
 }

 .hero-brand {
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2.2vw, 1.05rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-ink);
  flex-shrink: 0;
 }

 .hero-title {
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 6.5vw, 3.1rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--bbf-navy);
  text-shadow: none;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transform-origin: center bottom;
  animation: heroTitleIn 1.05s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)
   calc(var(--boot-splash-ms, 2000ms) + 0.2s) both;
 }

 .hero-lead {
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 34rem;
  font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 2.2vw, 1.1rem);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--bbf-ink);
  font-weight: 600;
  flex-shrink: 0;
 }

 .hero-witch-parallax {
  width: 100%;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  /* Más aire arriba (respecto al lead) y menos vacío abajo (respecto a CTAs) */
  padding-top: clamp(20px, 4.5svh, 44px);
  padding-bottom: clamp(8px, 1.5svh, 16px);
  will-change: transform;
 }

 .hero-witch-fly {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  min-height: 0;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: visible;
  /* Espera a que acabe el splash (2s) + un pelín */
  animation: witchFlyIn 1.15s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)
   calc(var(--boot-splash-ms, 2000ms) + 0.35s) both;
 }

 .hero-witch {
  width: auto;
  height: clamp(160px, 34svh, 420px);
  max-width: min(92vw, 520px);
  max-height: 100%;
  display: block;
  object-fit: contain;
  object-position: center 42%;
  transform-origin: center center;
  animation: witchFloat 2.8s ease-in-out
   calc(var(--boot-splash-ms, 2000ms) + 1.5s) infinite;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 18px rgba(32, 48, 72, 0.28));
 }

 .hero-witch.is-egg-spin {
  animation: witchEggSpin 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
 }

 .egg-toast {
  position: fixed;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  z-index: 9999;
  translate: -50% calc(-50% + 18px);
  margin: 0;
  padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 36px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 44px);
  width: min(92vw, 520px);
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  background:
   radial-gradient(
    ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 30%,
    color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-orange) 35%, var(--bbf-navy)) 0%,
    var(--bbf-navy) 70%
   );
  border: 4px solid var(--bbf-cream);
  box-shadow:
   8px 8px 0 var(--bbf-orange),
   0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: scale(0.88) rotate(-1.5deg);
  transition:
   opacity 0.35s ease,
   translate 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
   transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
 }

 .egg-toast.is-visible {
  opacity: 1;
  translate: -50% -50%;
  transform: scale(1) rotate(-1.5deg);
  animation: eggToastPop 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
 }

 .egg-toast-kicker,
 .egg-toast-title,
 .egg-toast-sub {
  margin: 0;
 }

 .egg-toast-kicker {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2.4vw, 1rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 75%, var(--bbf-orange));
  margin-bottom: 8px;
 }

 .egg-toast-title {
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 7.5vw, 3.2rem);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
 }

 .egg-toast-sub {
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.8vw, 1.2rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 85%, var(--bbf-orange));
 }

 .cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 148px;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition:
   transform 0.25s ease,
   box-shadow 0.25s ease,
   background-color 0.25s ease;
 }

 .cta-primary {
  background: color-mix(
   in srgb,
   var(--bbf-cream) calc(var(--scroll-night, 0) * 100%),
   var(--bbf-navy)
  );
  color: color-mix(
   in srgb,
   var(--bbf-navy) calc(var(--scroll-night, 0) * 100%),
   var(--bbf-cream)
  );
  box-shadow: 0 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  animation: ctaPulse 2.2s ease-in-out 1.8s infinite;
 }

 .cta-primary:hover {
  animation-play-state: paused;
  transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.03);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
 }

 .cta-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--bbf-ink);
  border: 2px solid var(--bbf-ink);
 }

 .cta-secondary:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-ink) 12%, transparent);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
 }

 .intro,
 .info,
 .countdown,
 .lineup,
 .closing {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: clamp(72px, 12vw, 120px) 20px;
 }

 .intro,
 .countdown,
 .lineup,
 .closing {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20px;
  text-align: center;
 }

 .countdown {
  gap: 8px;
 }

 .countdown-text {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 9vw, 4.2rem);
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bbf-navy);
 }

 .countdown-sub {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.4vw, 1.15rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
 }

 /* Desde intro hacia abajo: tipografía siempre clara (no sigue el scroll) */
 .intro,
 .info,
 .countdown,
 .lineup,
 .closing {
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
 }

 .intro :global(.typography),
 .lineup :global(.typography),
 .closing :global(.typography),
 .info {
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
 }

 .intro :global(.typography--headline-3),
 .lineup :global(.typography--headline-3),
 .closing :global(.typography--headline-3) {
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--bbf-navy);
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
 }

 /* className propia: Typography usa CSS modules hasheados */
 .lineup :global(.lineup-heading) {
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 4.5rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bbf-navy);
  padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
 }

 .info {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 28px;
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 35%, transparent);
  border-bottom: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 35%, transparent);
 }

 .info-label {
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
 }

 .info-value {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3.2vw, 1.55rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  line-height: 1.25;
 }

 .info-note {
  margin: 6px 0 0;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
 }

 .info-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
 }

 .info-link:hover {
  color: var(--bbf-orange);
 }

 .lineup-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 8px 0 16px;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
  transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
 }

 .lineup-item {
  --sticker-tilt: -2deg;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4.8vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(12px);
  animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease-out forwards;
 }


 .lineup-link {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: inline-block;
  background: transparent;
  border: 3px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 2px;
  padding: 0.08em 0.28em 0.04em;
  margin: 0 -0.28em;
  font: inherit;
  letter-spacing: inherit;
  text-transform: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
  transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1);
  box-shadow: none;
  outline: 1px dashed transparent;
  outline-offset: -7px;
  transition:
   color 0.2s ease,
   background-color 0.2s ease,
   border-color 0.2s ease,
   box-shadow 0.2s ease,
   transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
   outline-color 0.2s ease;
 }

 .lineup-link:hover,
 .lineup-link:focus-visible {
  color: var(--bbf-navy);
  background: var(--bbf-cream);
  border-color: var(--bbf-navy);
  outline-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-navy) 55%, transparent);
  text-shadow: none;
  box-shadow:
   5px 5px 0 var(--bbf-navy),
   0 10px 18px rgba(32, 48, 72, 0.18);
  transform: rotate(var(--sticker-tilt)) scale(1.05);
 }

 .lineup-link--special:hover,
 .lineup-link--special:focus-visible {
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  background: #0a0a0a;
  border-color: var(--bbf-cream);
  outline-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-orange) 70%, transparent);
  box-shadow:
   5px 5px 0 var(--bbf-orange),
   0 10px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
 }

 .children-modal {
  position: relative;
  width: min(92vw, 380px);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 28px 24px 32px;
  border: 3px solid #fff6eb;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: #0a0a0a;
  color: #fff6eb;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
 }

 .children-modal::backdrop {
  background: rgba(32, 48, 72, 0.72);
  backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
 }

 .children-modal[open] {
  animation: modalIn 0.28s ease-out;
 }

 .children-modal-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 8px;
  right: 12px;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  color: #fff6eb;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer;
  opacity: 0.75;
 }

 .children-modal-close:hover {
  opacity: 1;
 }

 .children-modal-skull {
  width: 140px;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  margin: 8px auto 18px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15));
 }

 .children-modal-title {
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-lineup);
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fff6eb;
 }

 .children-modal-text {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.98rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: rgba(255, 246, 235, 0.9);
 }

 @keyframes modalIn {
  from {
   opacity: 0;
   transform: scale(0.94) translateY(8px);
  }
  to {
   opacity: 1;
   transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
  }
 }

 .lineup-item:nth-child(1) {
  --sticker-tilt: -3.5deg;
  animation-delay: 0.05s;
 }
 .lineup-item:nth-child(2) {
  --sticker-tilt: 2.8deg;
  animation-delay: 0.12s;
 }
 .lineup-item:nth-child(3) {
  --sticker-tilt: -2deg;
  animation-delay: 0.19s;
 }
 .lineup-item:nth-child(4) {
  --sticker-tilt: 3.2deg;
  animation-delay: 0.26s;
 }
 .lineup-item:nth-child(5) {
  --sticker-tilt: -2.6deg;
  animation-delay: 0.33s;
 }

 .lineup :global(.lineup-djs) {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.45;
 }

 @media (min-width: 768px) {
  .lineup :global(.lineup-djs) {
   font-size: 1.35rem;
   max-width: 36rem;
   margin-left: auto;
   margin-right: auto;
  }
 }

 .closing {
  padding-bottom: clamp(96px, 14vw, 140px);
 }

 .closing .cta {
  align-self: center;
  margin-top: 8px;
 }

 .cta-closing {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
  overflow: visible;
 }

 .cta-closing::before,
 .cta-closing::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -10px;
  border-radius: inherit;
  z-index: -1;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
 }

 .cta-closing::before {
  background:
   radial-gradient(circle at 12% 30%, var(--bbf-orange) 0 3px, transparent 4px),
   radial-gradient(circle at 88% 25%, var(--bbf-cream) 0 2.5px, transparent 3.5px),
   radial-gradient(circle at 20% 85%, var(--bbf-cream) 0 2px, transparent 3px),
   radial-gradient(circle at 78% 80%, var(--bbf-orange) 0 3px, transparent 4px),
   radial-gradient(circle at 50% -4%, var(--bbf-orange) 0 2.5px, transparent 3.5px),
   radial-gradient(circle at 50% 108%, var(--bbf-cream) 0 2.5px, transparent 3.5px);
 }

 .cta-closing::after {
  transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  box-shadow:
   0 0 0 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-orange) 55%, transparent),
   0 0 28px 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-orange) 40%, transparent);
 }

 .cta-closing:hover,
 .cta-closing:focus-visible {
  animation: ctaClosingBuzz 0.45s ease-in-out;
  background: var(--bbf-orange);
  color: var(--bbf-cream);
  transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.08);
  box-shadow:
   0 10px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22),
   0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--bbf-cream) 55%, transparent);
 }

 .cta-closing:hover::after,
 .cta-closing:focus-visible::after {
  opacity: 1;
 }

 .cta-closing:hover::before,
 .cta-closing:focus-visible::before {
  /* Solo viven durante la animación; al final se quedan en opacity 0 */
  animation: ctaSparks 0.55s ease-out forwards;
 }

 @keyframes posterIn {
  to {
   opacity: 1;
   transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
  }
 }

 @keyframes fadeUp {
  to {
   opacity: 1;
   transform: translateY(0);
  }
 }

 @keyframes heroTitleIn {
  0% {
   color: transparent;
   -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--bbf-navy);
   text-shadow: none;
   transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.96);
  }
  42% {
   color: transparent;
   -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--bbf-cream);
   text-shadow: none;
   transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.03);
  }
  68% {
   color: var(--bbf-cream);
   -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--bbf-navy);
   text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bbf-navy);
   transform: translateY(2px) scale(1);
  }
  84% {
   transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.015);
  }
  100% {
   color: var(--bbf-cream);
   -webkit-text-stroke: 0 transparent;
   text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bbf-navy);
   transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
 }

 @keyframes witchFlyIn {
  from {
   opacity: 0;
   transform: translateX(-110vw);
  }
  to {
